# CatDex — Quality Gate

Before marking work ready for review:

1. **Typecheck** — `npm run typecheck` (and server tests if Vision touched)
2. **Lint** — project lint script if configured
3. **Design system** — `useTheme()` + shared components; no ad-hoc palette
4. **Critical path** — manually exercise the user story you changed
5. **Prefs / a11y** — reduced motion & haptics prefs not ignored on new feedback
6. **Env safety** — no secrets; API URL behavior documented if changed
7. **Git** — conventional commit; PR description with test plan

## Feature-specific gates

| Area | Extra check |
|------|-------------|
| Reward | Celebrate before edit; CTA clear |
| Onboarding | 4 beats still wired |
| Signup | Wizard steps + password meter |
| Map | FAB + permission gate |
| Analyze | Real errors surfaced; narrative loading |

Do not claim “done” on UI-only screenshots if the capture pipeline is untested when you touched it.
